{"lines":[{"w":0.06081995646158854,"c":1,"h":0.016051498603226633,"t":"Test 3","y":0.039939366949144461,"x":0.094832740123414846},{"w":0.17475728352864583,"h":0.016199376947040545,"x":0.097087377558271959,"y":0.090031152583617269,"c":1,"t":"Questions 36-40"},{"x":0.095067557864508476,"t":"Do the following statements agree with the views of the writer in Reading Passage 3?","w":0.80795125325520833,"c":1,"y":0.12489079020223615,"h":0.021853069650049961},{"c":1,"t":"In boxes 36-40 on your answer sheet, write","y":0.1641570512673779,"x":0.093125960954282425,"w":0.41377596537272138,"h":0.020341315819095596},{"w":0.044660193125406922,"c":1,"t":"YES","h":0.01453488311292217,"y":0.2020348839845596,"x":0.16699029169511748},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"x":0.16699029197442777,"t":"NO","y":0.22093023281023316,"w":0.033009707132975269},{"h":0.018535611636913529,"t":"if the statement agrees with the views of the writer","c":1,"x":0.30283070077877661,"y":0.20017599984351597,"w":0.47591445922851561},{"w":0.47184463500976559,"t":"if the statement contradicts the views of the writer","y":0.21947674427501374,"c":1,"x":0.30291263398253354,"h":0.016037274298266846},{"x":0.16699029934543849,"y":0.23831775724074145,"t":"NOT GIVEN if it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this","w":0.65825241088867181,"c":1,"h":0.017496196354661042},{"y":0.2741290965970069,"t":"36 The Vygotsky model of education supports the concept of a mixed-ability class.","c":1,"x":0.095082079146922918,"h":0.020998178167135229,"w":0.79234339396158848},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.30668604637840469,"c":1,"w":0.027184467315673838,"t":"37","x":0.095145630315277355},{"x":0.12415566675985493,"y":0.30176209483180716,"c":1,"w":0.78278213500976568,"h":0.022239979776637941,"t":"Some teachers are uncertain about allowing students to take on MKO roles in the"},{"c":1,"t":"classroom.","x":0.14145770776477717,"y":0.32708334028102215,"w":0.10742780049641928,"h":0.015750604552271952},{"c":1,"x":0.095145642360158336,"t":"38 It can be rewarding to teach knowledge which you have only recently acquired.","w":0.79029123942057289,"h":0.017471745452405485,"y":0.35607476628315105},{"h":0.019538198453243671,"y":0.38366740812751199,"c":1,"x":0.095072305687199044,"t":"39 The priority should be to ensure that the highest-achieving students attain their","w":0.78850840250651033},{"y":0.40697674408292039,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"goals.","x":0.14174757461009993,"w":0.062135918935139978,"c":1},{"w":0.79047190348307284,"t":"40 Taking part in collaborative outdoor activities with teachers and classmates can","x":0.09505507698624352,"h":0.019892179780288677,"c":1,"y":0.43261576792737944},{"x":0.13786408334997741,"t":"improve student outcomes in the classroom.","y":0.45482866030706925,"w":0.42330095926920569,"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1},{"x":0.097087379438723476,"w":0.029126211802164709,"c":1,"t":"74","y":0.95639534908530976,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"c":1,"t":"→ 0 p. 124","x":0.15334143851304058,"h":0.018490454415294511,"y":0.95514564150007719,"w":0.13809488932291666}],"h":3209,"w":2400}